{
  "info": {
    "name": "Fluxy API",
    "description": "Personal finance REST API (Fluxy) — coleção para teste manual das rotas.\n\nFluxo para começar do zero:\n1. `Auth / Signup → Start signup` — dispara o e-mail com o código.\n2. Copie o código de 6 dígitos do log do servidor (`[email] verification code for <...>: 123456`)\n   e cole na variável de environment `otpCode`.\n3. `Verify code` → grava `signupToken`. `Complete signup` → grava `accessToken` e `refreshToken`.\n4. `Categories → List categories` grava um `categoryId`, que `Transactions → Create transaction` usa.\n\nO Bearer está definido no nível da coleção como `{{accessToken}}`; as rotas públicas usam No Auth.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Infra",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe. Devolve status, stage e timestamp.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth / Signup",
      "description": "Na ordem do fluxo: start → verify → complete.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Start signup",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/start",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "signup",
                "start"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envia sempre exatamente um e-mail: um código de 6 dígitos quando o endereço está livre,\nou um aviso de tentativa de cadastro quando já é uma conta. A resposta é sempre 202 com a\nmesma mensagem, independente do caso. Chamar de novo é como se reenvia o código.\n\nSem RESEND_API_KEY o código cai no log do servidor. Copie e cole em `otpCode`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify code",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/verify",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "signup",
                "verify"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confere o código e devolve um signupToken de vida curta, que só autoriza completar o cadastro. Grava `signupToken`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.signupToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('signupToken', data.signupToken)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Complete signup",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/complete",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "signup",
                "complete"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria a conta já verificada, semeia as categorias padrão e autentica. Grava `accessToken` e `refreshToken`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"signupToken\": \"{{signupToken}}\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Gustavo\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Azevedo\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\",\n  \"passwordConfirmation\": \"{{testPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', data.accessToken)",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth / Session",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Autentica e grava `accessToken` e `refreshToken`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', data.accessToken)",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rotaciona o par de tokens e regrava as duas variáveis.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', data.accessToken)",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revoga o refresh token. Limpa `accessToken` e `refreshToken` do environment.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', '')",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', '')",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get current account",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dados da conta autenticada. Usa o Bearer herdado da coleção."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "change-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Troca a senha da conta autenticada. Se usar isto, lembre de atualizar `testPassword` para continuar conseguindo logar.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"{{testPassword}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NovaSenha!456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Dispara o e-mail de redefinição. Sem RESEND_API_KEY o link cai no log do servidor\n(`[email] password reset link for ...`). Copie o valor do parâmetro `token` do link\ne cole na variável `resetToken`.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{testEmail}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "reset-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Redefine a senha usando o token do e-mail de recuperação.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{testPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "categories"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "kind",
                  "value": "expense",
                  "description": "expense | income",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "includeArchived",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "boolean",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista as categorias da conta. Grava a primeira em `categoryId` se a variável ainda estiver vazia."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (Array.isArray(data) && data.length > 0 && !pm.environment.get('categoryId')) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('categoryId', data[0].id)",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create category",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "categories"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria uma categoria e grava o id em `categoryId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Assinaturas\",\n  \"kind\": \"expense\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.id) pm.environment.set('categoryId', data.id)"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get category",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "categories",
                "{{categoryId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Busca uma categoria pelo id."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rename category",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "categories",
                "{{categoryId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Só o nome pode ser alterado; o kind é imutável.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Assinaturas e serviços\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete category",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "categories",
                "{{categoryId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devolve 204. Categoria em uso por alguma transação é arquivada; sem uso, é removida de vez."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Transactions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List transactions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transactions"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "from",
                  "value": "2026-01-01",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "to",
                  "value": "2026-12-31",
                  "description": "YYYY-MM-DD",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "categoryId",
                  "value": "{{categoryId}}",
                  "description": "uuid",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "kind",
                  "value": "expense",
                  "description": "expense | income",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "1..100, default 20",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "cursor",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "nextCursor da página anterior",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista paginada por keyset. Reenvie o `nextCursor` da resposta em `?cursor=` para a próxima página."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create transaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transactions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "amountCents é inteiro e positivo, em centavos (2190 = R$ 21,90). occurredAt no formato YYYY-MM-DD. Grava o id em `transactionId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Spotify\",\n  \"amountCents\": 2190,\n  \"kind\": \"expense\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-08-01\",\n  \"description\": \"Plano familiar\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json()",
                  "if (data.id) pm.environment.set('transactionId', data.id)"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get transaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transactions",
                "{{transactionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Busca uma transação pelo id."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update transaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transactions",
                "{{transactionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Todos os campos são opcionais; envie só o que mudou. `description` aceita null para limpar.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Spotify Família\",\n  \"amountCents\": 3490\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete transaction",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "transactions",
                "{{transactionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Devolve 204."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reports",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Summary",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reports/summary",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reports",
                "summary"
              ],
              "query": [
